  <uml:Model xmi:id="_VR3ZkGySEfCSnqVOFxkkdw" name="Patterns_GenericDiagrams_Project">
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_D2iJ0PuaEfCHPf21WSHTTA" annotatedElement="_7fNr0PuUEfCHPf21WSHTTA">
      <body>A DTS-Related  system could be:&#xD;
- A tool necessary for the modeling, the design, the simulation, the implementation, the deployment, the Verification &amp; the Validation ... of A DTS;&#xD;
- A sub-system of a DTS (Gregory et al.2024) :Digital Twin Entity, Connection/Synchornization Layer, HMIs, DBMs....&#xD;
- A sub-system of a DTS' sub-system's (Simulation Model, AI Model...)&#xD;
... </body>
    </ownedComment>
